Final Model Artifact

The final model is saved as models/final_hgb_pipeline.joblib. The accompanying classification threshold is saved as models/final_threshold.joblib.

The pipeline contains the complete feature-engineering, preprocessing, and HistGradientBoosting model workflow.

How to Infer
import joblib

# Load the saved pipeline and threshold
model = joblib.load("models/final_hgb_pipeline.joblib")
threshold = joblib.load("models/final_threshold.joblib")

# Generate probability for the positive class
probability = model.predict_proba(new_data)[:, 1]

# Apply the selected threshold
prediction = (probability >= threshold).astype(int)

The final classification threshold is 0.35, selected using the validation set by maximizing F1-score. The threshold was kept fixed when evaluating the untouched test set.

Final Test Performance
Accuracy: 0.8613
Precision: 0.6850
Recall: 0.7784
F1-score: 0.7287
ROC AUC: 0.9280
PR AUC: 0.8295
